This repo is the Hexo source for https://qgu.io/blog. Full guide: AGENTS.md.

- Edit source/_posts/*.md. main is the Hexo source; gh-pages is generated.
- Never commit public/, db.json, or node_modules/. Never push to main; open a PR.
- Leave a blank line before every Markdown table, or it renders as plain text.
- Multi-language posts share a slug: <slug>.md (en), <slug>-fr.md (fr), <slug>-cn.md (中).
- Validate: npm install && node .github/setup-mathjax.js && npm run build
